- **Kafka Connection**: Verifies connectivity to Kafka brokers
- **Schema Registry Connection**: Verifies Schema Registry availability
- **Producer Health**: Checks producer buffer capacity and errors
- **Consumer Health**: Checks consumer lag and processing errors
- **Outbox Health**: Checks outbox table size and processing lag (if enabled)

